Homepage: https://github.com/sched-ext/scx-loader
Description: DBus loader daemon for sched_ext schedulers
 scx_loader is a system daemon and DBus-based loader for sched_ext
 schedulers, providing the org.scx.Loader system bus interface.
 .
 This package ships:
  * scx_loader - the loader daemon (dbus-activated system service)
  * scxctl     - command line client (get/list/start/switch/stop/...)
  * scxtui     - terminal UI for scheduler management and status
 .
 Configure via /etc/scx_loader.toml; enable with
 `systemctl enable --now scx_loader.service`.

